  "body": "## Changelog\n* e5f47220ef56d65e24759eb765d224593951f81c Bump brace-expansion from 1.1.18 to 1.1.21 in /docs (#1248)\n* 86db4eb6a47e956a7ebd3d3f33941cf577d9ef1f Bump compression from 1.7.4 to 1.8.2 in /docs (#1251)\n* 1038b3c1e51fd92a8b12f25d193e842a92dc3d25 Bump js-yaml from 3.14.1 to 3.15.2 in /docs (#1238)\n* 570ed9bdc9d01fe092c7ddc6c87ab475e8142781 Bump postcss-selector-parser from 6.1.1 to 6.1.4 in /docs (#1249)\n* 1bc9aa541192e0c0a6543720f3b434a4469c37c8 Bump proxy-addr from 2.0.7 to 2.0.8 in /docs (#1253)\n* b642db5ede4c6f57638e29986db4636112c4b465 Bump source-map-js from 1.2.0 to 1.2.2 in /docs (#1252)\n* cb4739638fb926a349226b86b93376fcdc4b7dcf INS-3142: Fix CVE-2026-111943 for polaris (#1265)\n* 33330a6f02c905ea1a7f771c9531308d7385e10b Managed by Terraform\n* 6e76dd36aea6a5d8dd380ddf3e9199a83d252c55 Managed by Terraform\n* 6c3eff9cc6044bf5144cddcdda6b6f7be42b95ee Managed by Terraform\n* c3151b3f73aa30e6126a312060fff83f1325698a Pin dependencies (#1263)\n* 547d7b36b9b4987468f053affe31be32d3dcdb63 Update all non-major dependencies to v0.37.1 (#1247)\n* 4ced8e86db4d6cfe99ed8705ee687b9b9eeb566a Update alpine Docker tag to v3.24.2 (#1246)\n* b619e6af2527850a23a8f8997014d09c78ffa5bc Update alpine Docker tag to v3.24.3 (#1262)\n* 6231fc3b5f81d4c2cae637e3ded1e6c84a299145 Update dependency vuepress-plugin-check-md to v0.0.3 (#1264)\n* 8b0645e5f9a092c9b5abe2c6e2799d3a52e49d6f Update module sigs.k8s.io/controller-runtime to v0.25.1 (#1245)\n* ca9a859482ee6c3d324124f1e52b551d0bc45b3b Update module sigs.k8s.io/controller-runtime to v0.25.2 (#1250)\n\nYou can verify the signatures of both the checksums.txt file and the published docker images using [cosign](https://github.com/sigstore/cosign).\n\n```bash\ncosign verify-blob checksums.txt --bundle=checksums.txt.sigstore.json --key https://artifacts.fairwinds.com/cosign-p256.pub\n```\n\n```bash\ncosign verify us-docker.pkg.dev/fairwinds-ops/oss/polaris:v10.2.6 --key https://artifacts.fairwinds.com/cosign-p256.pub\n```\n\n"
